WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
I ended seven wars,

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.080
dealt with the leaders of each and every one of these countries,

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:08.040
and never even received a phone call from the United Nations

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.880
offering to help in finalizing.

